**Aditya Birla Fashion and Retail** carried a **Rs 5.10 crore** board-outcome item, and **BCC Fuba India**, **GTV Engineering** and **Bansal Wire Industries** convened board meetings, the last to consider a share sub-division.","**Already published:** **Neetu Yoshi's** Haridwar commissioning ran on 07-Aug; today's release adds that production starts **13-Sep-2026** and that the plant was funded from IPO proceeds."],"distress_risk":["**Coastal Corporation** - after a **credit-rating revision**, tells the exchanges its banker has confirmed the disputed repayment dates are **value-dating and system processing**, not missed obligations; the email is annexed.","**Ultracab (India)** - SEBI's adjudicating officer imposes a **Rs 5 lakh penalty, jointly and severally, on promoter and promoter-group entities** over undisclosed 2023 shareholding changes; the company says it bears no impact.","**Paradeep Phosphates** - the **Supreme Court dismisses the Department of Fertilizers' appeal**, leaving standing the order to release **Rs 53.50 crore of nutrient-based subsidy with interest** _(~0.34% of mcap)_.","**DPSC (now India Power Corporation)** - declares the voting results of the **second Committee of Creditors meeting in its own insolvency**, including the resolution professional's appointment, and calls a third.","**Impex Ferro Tech** (resolution plan filed), **Sun Granite Export** (claims invited), **Burnpur Cement**, **A.F. Enterprises** and **Unitech International** filed insolvency steps, none carrying a quantified impact.","**Honasa Consumer** reports a **Dubai Cassation Court judgment in the RSM General Trading matter** with no impact figure, and **Cemindia Projects** and **ICICI Lombard** filed pendency-of-litigation disclosures."],"equity_allotments":["**RNFI Services** allotted shares **against warrants**, a past conversion with no amount stated, and **Kanpur Plastipack** convened its Preferential Issue Committee for 13-Aug to convert warrants.","**Chemkart India** - subscribes a further **Rs 1.00 crore** to the rights issue of **Easy Raw Materials, its own wholly-owned subsidiary**, from IPO proceeds _(~0.4% of mcap)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Par Drugs and Chemicals** carried lakh-scale figures in a flagged board outcome, **Neueon Corporation** cancelled a committee meeting, and **Dollex Agrotech** received NSE in-principle approval with no amount stated."],"m_and_a":["**RDB Infrastructure and Power** - enters a **reconstituted partnership deed to acquire M/s Arankam Green Energy Solution**; neither the intimation nor its annexure discloses a consideration.","**Aashka Hospitals** - signs a memorandum of understanding for a **strategic partnership with four Rhythm and Cardioplus healthcare entities**, with no consideration and no committed spend.","**Tinna Rubber and Infrastructure** - remits a first tranche of **US$ 100,000, which the filing itself puts at INR 95,26,500**, as a loan to its South African joint venture **Mbodla Investments**.","**Zenlabs Ethica**, **Orbit Exports**, **Studds Accessories**, **Salasar Techno Engineering**, **Max Financial Services** and **Jindal Poly Films** filed agreements, subsidiary infusions and scheme steps with **no consideration stated**."],"order_wins":["**Abha Power and Steel** - a **Rs 1.90 crore order from a Railway OEM the filing declines to name**, taking its stated order book to about **Rs 19.00 crore** _(~3.9% of mcap)_.","**Valplast Technologies** - an order from **Ajanma Industries LLP** to supply, erect and commission ferrous and non-ferrous items for railway projects; the annexure states no contract value.","**Zaggle Prepaid Ocean Services** - amends its 29-June agreement with **APAC Financial Services** to add **Zaggle Employee Tax Benefits**; no value is disclosed.","**Already published:** **Axis Solutions'** Rs 400 crore NKG Primus water-supply order ran on 05-Aug and **Sattva Engineering's** Rs 11.22 crore Bimbo Bakeries order on 07-Aug; today's filings are the press releases of each."],"other_notable":["**Refex Renewables & Infrastructure** - discloses an inter-se transfer of **13,91,869 shares, 30.94% of capital, from Avyan Pashupathy Capital Advisors to Refex Holding**, both promoters; Avyan will seek reclassification out.","**Mayank Cattle Food** - fixes **24-Aug-2026** as the record date for a **1:1 bonus issue**.","**Rating actions, none a notch change:** **Prince Pipes** reaffirmed at Crisil A+/Negative and A1+ on Rs 768 crore of facilities, **Manaksia Steels** moved from CARE to ICRA, and **GNFC**, **Zensar**, **Precision Wires** and **Embassy REIT** disclosed no notch change."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Gabriel India Limited","date":"2026-08-10","days":2,"detail":"Scheme of amalgamation listed · allotted 09-06-2026","instrument_id":"14570","mcap":20720.6,"pct":18.21,"pct_of":"equity","shares":33586083,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"GABRIEL","type":"AMALGAMATION","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260807-15/20260807-15.pdf"},{"company":"Ramkrishna Forgings Ltd","date":"2026-08-10","days":2,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"13881","mcap":13728.5,"pct":0.18,"pct_of":"equity","shares":335000,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"RKFORGE","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260807-19/20260807-19.pdf"},{"company":"Blue Cloud Softech Solutions Limited","date":"2026-08-10","days":2,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"13760","mcap":2015.1,"pct":18.42,"pct_of":"equity","shares":170000000,"src":"BSE","symbol":"BLUECLOUDS","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260807-5/20260807-5.pdf"},{"company":"Arvind Ltd","date":"2026-08-10","days":2,"detail":"QIP placement listed · allotted 05-08-2026","instrument_id":"10358","mcap":14478.0,"pct":3.64,"pct_of":"equity","shares":9900990,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"ARVIND","type":"QIP","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/